OL,3,ANY's governor appoints special
OL,4,Aprosecutor in Cornell frat rape
OL,5,Ainvestigation
OL,6,
OL,7,FNew York Governor Kathy Hochul has
OL,8,Fappointed the state's attorney general,
OL,9,FLetitia James, as a special prosecutor
OL,10,Fin investigating the alleged gang rape
OL,11,Fof a woman at Cornell University.
OL,13,FThe woman has alleged she was drugged
OL,14,Fand raped by several men at a
OL,15,Ffraternity house. The case, which stems
OL,16,Fback to 2024, was reopened after the
OL,17,Fwoman filed a civil lawsuit last month
OL,18,Fthat thrust the allegations into the
OL,19,Fnational spotlight.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
